      <p class="tag">Mission 5</p>
      <h1>Cyber Responder</h1>
      <p class="mission-intro">Learn what to do when something feels wrong online.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="lesson-box">
    <h2>Step 1: Learn</h2>
    <p>If you find a scam or something unsafe online, do not click, reply, or keep engaging.</p>
    <p>You should stop, save proof if needed, block, report, and tell a trusted adult.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="lesson-box">
    <h2>Step 2: Response Plan</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>STOP:</strong> Do not click sketchy links.</li>
      <li><strong>SCREENSHOT:</strong> Save proof if needed.</li>
      <li><strong>BLOCK:</strong> Do not allow them to message you again.</li>
      <li><strong>TELL:</strong> Tell an adult or report the account.</li>
    </ul>
  </div>

  <div class="lesson-box">
    <h2>Step 3: Practice</h2>
    <p>Someone sends you a suspicious link and asks for your password. What should you do?</p>
    <button onclick="showResult('responderResult', false)">Click it to check</button>
    <button onclick="showResult('responderResult', true)">Stop, block, and tell an adult</button>
    <p id="responderResult" class="result-text"></p>
  </div>

